# Blast from the Past (windurst 11): the turn-in reads no Option (kept as the Lua file has it: Koru-Moru's trade tests
# the stone alone). Accepted by GM at Option 1 with the Burnite Shell Stone: the stone alone with a full bag (224: the
# club does not fit, nothing, the stone kept); Option 0 by GM: the stone alone (224: completed, fame 30, the Great Club,
# Fossilized Sea Farer, the stone taken, Nothing Matters' mustZone 239). The main flow turns it in at Option 2.
lists WindurstWalls/Koru-Moru/onTrade WindurstWalls/onEventFinish/224
char zone=WindurstWalls pos=-120.2,-5.5,122.4 lvl=75
quest Windurst.BlastFromThePast accepted
charvar Quest[2][11]Option 1
item BurniteShellStone
login
fill-inventory
trade Koru-Moru BurniteShellStone x1           # Option 1, the stone alone: 224
finish                                         # full: quest:complete false: nothing, the stone kept
free-inventory
charvar Quest[2][11]Option 0                   # GM
trade Koru-Moru BurniteShellStone x1           # Option 0, the stone alone: 224
finish                                         # completed; the stone taken; Quest[2][79]mustZone 239
